ci: decouple typecheck from harness checkout; pin deps to published versions

The release workflow failed because tsconfig paths/typeRoots pointed at a
local DeepSeek Harness checkout that CI does not have. All @deepseek-ai/*
types and implementations now resolve from the published npm packages
(cordis 4.0.1, dsh-settings/host-webserver/credentials at 0.1.0-rc.6 which
carry the webServer augmentation). Removed the harness-clone step from the
workflow and updated the README dev prerequisites to match.

- tsconfig.json: drop checkout paths/typeRoots
- package.json: devDependencies pinned to published versions
- release.yml: no longer clones deepseek-harness
- README: dev setup is now 'npm i', no checkout needed
